  name "the-object-of-every-type-spelling"
  note "Every type spelling a document writes lowers under the tag the page gives it: the scalars with null and never, a range with its edges, a dictionary, the marks var, inout, linear, consuming and borrowing, the nullable, a procedure type with the types it takes and answers and its claims, a type parameter, and the reading a walk through one derives, written under answers."
